{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CAMPS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CAMPS is a framework focused on delivering an open-world tactical sandbox experience, providing solo and team players with the tools to experiment with a wide range of strategies, mechanics, and gameplay features.  <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This project isn't a war simulator and doesn't depict real-life events or conflicts.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main aim is to create a comprehensive open world tactical playground for solo and team players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currently, the game supports up to 20 players per server, with various team-based gameplay modes. <br><i>The future plans include expanding the number of concurrent players to 50 per server as network and in-game optimizations allow.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MECHANICS</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/Boat_3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746225077\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CAMPS provides a field for various experiments, allowing the combination of all types of game mechanics from fighting to flying jetpacks.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INJURY SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/Fight1.gif?t=1746225077\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The injury system extends beyond just characters. Infantry can suffer everything from bleeding wounds to explosive contusions, while vehicles experience engine failures, fuel leaks, and more.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DESTRUCTIBLE ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/Destruction_2.gif?t=1746225077\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trees, buildings, and objects react to your actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The destruction system brings exciting possibilities, and future updates will expand the number of destructible elements.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also provides ballistics, ricochets and various types of surface penetrations. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/Inventory.gif?t=1746225077\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's current state offers a wide array of arsenal abilities, ranging from ground traps to artillery. The plan is to continuously expand the weapons arsenal, providing items to suit every player's taste.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2882560?t=1746225077","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746225077","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/fe7336a2a200122cb3b7489bc5f0d7364e4664bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746225077","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/fe7336a2a200122cb3b7489bc5f0d7364e4664bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746225077","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains mature content, including depictions of violence, drug/alcohol use. Review the game's content warnings and ratings before playing."},"demos":[{"appid":2884090,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>CAMPS</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CAMPS is a framework focused on delivering an open-world tactical sandbox experience, providing solo and team players with the tools to experiment with a wide range of strategies, mechanics, and gameplay features.  <br>  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE GOAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This project isn't a war simulator and doesn't depict real-life events or conflicts.</strong>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main aim is to create a comprehensive open world tactical playground for solo and team players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>MULTIPLAYER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Currently, the game supports up to 20 players per server, with various team-based gameplay modes. <br><i>The future plans include expanding the number of concurrent players to 50 per server as network and in-game optimizations allow.</i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GAME MECHANICS</strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/Boat_3-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746225077\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CAMPS provides a field for various experiments, allowing the combination of all types of game mechanics from fighting to flying jetpacks.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>INJURY SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/Fight1.gif?t=1746225077\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The injury system extends beyond just characters. Infantry can suffer everything from bleeding wounds to explosive contusions, while vehicles experience engine failures, fuel leaks, and more.   </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DESTRUCTIBLE ENVIRONMENT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/Destruction_2.gif?t=1746225077\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trees, buildings, and objects react to your actions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The destruction system brings exciting possibilities, and future updates will expand the number of destructible elements.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game also provides ballistics, ricochets and various types of surface penetrations. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ARSENAL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/extras/Inventory.gif?t=1746225077\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game's current state offers a wide array of arsenal abilities, ranging from ground traps to artillery. The plan is to continuously expand the weapons arsenal, providing items to suit every player's taste.</p>","developers":["Millenary Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/header.jpg?t=1746225077","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257042677,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257042677/movie480.mp4?t=1722551245","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257042677/movie_max.mp4?t=1722551245"},"name":"CAMPS: Short Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257042677/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1722551245","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257042677/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1722551245","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257042677/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1722551245"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257024360,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257024360/movie480.mp4?t=1716203058","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257024360/movie_max.mp4?t=171620