tps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882560/cacb93a670ed192334d13336d27e310b4fed1131/ss_cacb93a670ed192334d13336d27e310b4fed1131.600x338.jpg?t=1746225077"}],"short_description":"CAMPS is an open-world tactical sandbox. Immerse yourself in a fully procedurally generated expanse featuring diverse biomes. Taking a role of a mercenary, complete contracts, gather resources, team up with others, and grow your private military company.","steam_appid":2882560,"support_info":{"email":"millenaryinfo@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Finnish, Russian","type":"game","website":null}